Gabriel S. Esterhuizen, Dennis R. Dolinar, John L. Ellenberger, and Leonard J. Prosser Jr. Pillar and Roof Span Design Guidelines for Underground Stone Mines. NIOSH Publication 2011-171, Information Circular 9526, May 2011. [Official report and full text](https://stacks.cdc.gov/view/cdc/23444).

Read the full methods, observational database, empirical applicability, ground mechanisms, design procedures, examples, uncertainty, and limits. The stone-mine setting, geology, dimensions, discontinuities, loading, and data domain matter; a criterion from this report is not a universal value for every mine or rock mass.

Official authors, year, identifiers, context, and access checked on 29 October 2026. The report states public-domain status; preserve separately credited components and actual notices. This is a dated engineering research guideline, compared with current site/professional requirements during practical work. No report or mine dataset is copied here.

